  "description": ".NET library for Wii U formats: title IDs, product codes, regions, per-language names, meta and app XML; NUS packages (pack, unpack, download, TMD, ticket, FST); NFS containers for Wii-mode titles; RPX/RPL executables; WUD/WUX disc dumps read with their disc key and written out as installable packages; the Wii U Menu layout file; Aroma and homebrew_on_menu paths.",
